<template>
  <j-page class="store-page catalog-page">
    <main>
      <section class="catalog-hero" aria-labelledby="catalog-title">
        <div class="catalog-hero__copy">
          <j-chip class="status-chip--official">
            <j-icon name="verified" aria-hidden="true"></j-icon>
            Official catalog preview
          </j-chip>
          <h1 id="catalog-title">Ready-to-run applications, with <em>trust you can inspect</em>.</h1>
          <p>
            Discover NexRun application packages with declared resources, secrets, storage,
            compatibility, and verification evidence before anything reaches your host.
          </p>
          <div class="hero-actions">
            <j-button class="primary-action" variant="filled" to="#featured">
              Browse packages
              <j-icon name="arrow_downward" aria-hidden="true"></j-icon>
            </j-button>
            <j-button class="secondary-action" variant="text" to="/security">How verification works</j-button>
          </div>
          <div class="hero-facts" aria-label="Catalog facts">
            <span><j-icon name="deployed_code" aria-hidden="true"></j-icon>3 source kits</span>
            <span><j-icon name="verified_user" aria-hidden="true"></j-icon>1 official publisher</span>
            <span><j-icon name="pending" aria-hidden="true"></j-icon>0 sealed releases so far</span>
          </div>
        </div>

        <j-card class="assurance-card">
          <j-card-section>
            <div class="record-head">
              <j-icon name="receipt_long" aria-hidden="true"></j-icon>
              <strong>Release record</strong>
              <j-chip>required fields</j-chip>
            </div>
            <ul class="assurance-list">
              <li>
                <span class="icon-tile"><j-icon name="fingerprint" aria-hidden="true"></j-icon></span>
                <div>
                  <strong>Immutable identity</strong>
                  <small>sha256 manifest digest</small>
                </div>
                <j-icon class="record-check" name="radio_button_unchecked" aria-hidden="true"></j-icon>
              </li>
              <li>
                <span class="icon-tile"><j-icon name="verified_user" aria-hidden="true"></j-icon></span>
                <div>
                  <strong>Publisher trust</strong>
                  <small>signer matches explicit policy</small>
                </div>
                <j-icon class="record-check" name="radio_button_unchecked" aria-hidden="true"></j-icon>
              </li>
              <li>
                <span class="icon-tile"><j-icon name="schema" aria-hidden="true"></j-icon></span>
                <div>
                  <strong>Traceable build</strong>
                  <small>signed provenance chain</small>
                </div>
                <j-icon class="record-check" name="radio_button_unchecked" aria-hidden="true"></j-icon>
              </li>
              <li>
                <span class="icon-tile"><j-icon name="fact_check" aria-hidden="true"></j-icon></span>
                <div>
                  <strong>Operational evidence</strong>
                  <small>install · restart · restore</small>
                </div>
                <j-icon class="record-check" name="radio_button_unchecked" aria-hidden="true"></j-icon>
              </li>
              <li>
                <span class="icon-tile"><j-icon name="policy" aria-hidden="true"></j-icon></span>
                <div>
                  <strong>Endorsement level</strong>
                  <small>official · verified · community</small>
                </div>
                <j-icon class="record-check" name="radio_button_unchecked" aria-hidden="true"></j-icon>
              </li>
            </ul>
            <p class="record-foot">
              This is what the catalog schema will require of a sealed release — not
              what any entry has met yet. No package here carries a digest or signature
              today; every entry stays a reviewed <code>source-kit</code> until the
              publishing pipeline goes live.
            </p>
          </j-card-section>
        </j-card>
      </section>

      <section class="catalog-section" id="featured" aria-labelledby="featured-title">
        <div class="section-heading">
          <div>
            <span class="eyebrow">Seed catalog</span>
            <h2 id="featured-title">Official source kits</h2>
          </div>
          <p>Reviewed NexRun examples awaiting the immutable publishing pipeline.</p>
        </div>

        <div class="package-grid">
          <j-card class="package-card package-card--featured">
            <j-card-section>
              <div class="package-card__topline">
                <span class="package-icon package-icon--mysql" aria-hidden="true">
                  <j-icon name="database"></j-icon>
                </span>
                <div class="package-badges">
                  <j-badge class="trust-badge">
                    <j-icon name="verified" aria-hidden="true"></j-icon>
                    Official
                  </j-badge>
                  <j-badge class="preview-badge">Source kit</j-badge>
                </div>
              </div>
              <div class="package-card__body">
                <span class="package-publisher">
                  Nextera
                  <j-icon name="verified" aria-hidden="true"></j-icon>
                </span>
                <h3>MySQL <span class="package-version">8.4</span></h3>
                <p>Stateful MySQL with fenced persistent storage, secret delivery, health checks, and a restore-drill runbook.</p>
              </div>
              <div class="spec-grid" aria-label="Runtime requirements">
                <span><j-icon name="deployed_code" aria-hidden="true"></j-icon>OCI runtime</span>
                <span><j-icon name="memory" aria-hidden="true"></j-icon>2 GiB RAM</span>
                <span><j-icon name="hard_drive" aria-hidden="true"></j-icon>2 volumes</span>
                <span><j-icon name="key" aria-hidden="true"></j-icon>1 secret</span>
              </div>
            </j-card-section>
            <j-card-actions>
              <span class="pipeline-status pipeline-status--muted">
                <j-icon name="tag" aria-hidden="true"></j-icon>
                nextera/mysql
              </span>
              <j-button class="card-action card-action--stretch" variant="filled" to="/apps/nextera/mysql">
                Review package
                <j-icon name="arrow_forward" aria-hidden="true"></j-icon>
              </j-button>
            </j-card-actions>
          </j-card>

          <j-card class="package-card">
            <j-card-section>
              <div class="package-card__topline">
                <span class="package-icon package-icon--web" aria-hidden="true">
                  <j-icon name="language"></j-icon>
                </span>
                <div class="package-badges">
                  <j-badge class="trust-badge">
                    <j-icon name="verified" aria-hidden="true"></j-icon>
                    Official
                  </j-badge>
                  <j-badge class="preview-badge">Source kit</j-badge>
                </div>
              </div>
              <div class="package-card__body">
                <span class="package-publisher">
                  Nextera
                  <j-icon name="verified" aria-hidden="true"></j-icon>
                </span>
                <h3>Static SPA</h3>
                <p>Serve a compiled single-page application directly from NexRun — no container or web-server sidecar.</p>
              </div>
              <div class="spec-grid" aria-label="Runtime requirements">
                <span><j-icon name="deployed_code" aria-hidden="true"></j-icon>Static runtime</span>
                <span><j-icon name="lan" aria-hidden="true"></j-icon>Port 8080</span>
                <span><j-icon name="hard_drive" aria-hidden="true"></j-icon>No volumes</span>
                <span><j-icon name="key" aria-hidden="true"></j-icon>No secrets</span>
              </div>
            </j-card-section>
            <j-card-actions>
              <span class="pipeline-status">
                <j-icon name="schedule" aria-hidden="true"></j-icon>
                Detail page in progress
              </span>
            </j-card-actions>
          </j-card>

          <j-card class="package-card">
            <j-card-section>
              <div class="package-card__topline">
                <span class="package-icon package-icon--dobase" aria-hidden="true">
                  <j-icon name="storage"></j-icon>
                </span>
                <div class="package-badges">
                  <j-badge class="trust-badge">
                    <j-icon name="verified" aria-hidden="true"></j-icon>
                    Official
                  </j-badge>
                  <j-badge class="preview-badge">Source kit</j-badge>
                </div>
              </div>
              <div class="package-card__body">
                <span class="package-publisher">
                  Nextera
                  <j-icon name="verified" aria-hidden="true"></j-icon>
                </span>
                <h3>Dobase</h3>
                <p>Durable single-writer deployment with scoped secrets, persistent data, backups, and production gates.</p>
              </div>
              <div class="spec-grid" aria-label="Runtime requirements">
                <span><j-icon name="deployed_code" aria-hidden="true"></j-icon>OCI runtime</span>
                <span><j-icon name="memory" aria-hidden="true"></j-icon>8 GiB RAM</span>
                <span><j-icon name="hard_drive" aria-hidden="true"></j-icon>2 volumes</span>
                <span><j-icon name="key" aria-hidden="true"></j-icon>7 secrets</span>
              </div>
            </j-card-section>
            <j-card-actions>
              <span class="pipeline-status">
                <j-icon name="pending" aria-hidden="true"></j-icon>
                Awaiting image digest
              </span>
            </j-card-actions>
          </j-card>
        </div>
      </section>

      <section class="trust-callout" aria-labelledby="trust-title">
        <span class="icon-tile" aria-hidden="true"><j-icon name="policy"></j-icon></span>
        <div>
          <span class="eyebrow">Trust is a policy</span>
          <h2 id="trust-title">A signature is the beginning of verification — not the end.</h2>
          <p>
            NexRun checks content integrity and signer possession. The Store adds publisher identity,
            immutable release metadata, evidence, and an explicit level of endorsement.
          </p>
        </div>
        <j-button class="secondary-action" variant="text" to="/security">
          Read the trust model
          <j-icon name="arrow_forward" aria-hidden="true"></j-icon>
        </j-button>
      </section>

      <section class="catalog-section lifecycle-section" aria-labelledby="lifecycle-title">
        <div class="section-heading">
          <div>
            <span class="eyebrow">From source to instance</span>
            <h2 id="lifecycle-title">One transparent release path</h2>
          </div>
          <p>Every stage leaves signed, inspectable output for the next one.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="lifecycle-grid">
          <j-card class="pipeline-step">
            <j-card-section>
              <div class="pipeline-step__head">
                <span class="pipeline-step__num">01</span>
                <j-icon name="rule" aria-hidden="true"></j-icon>
              </div>
              <h3>Validate</h3>
              <p>Strict IDEL parsing and declared capability review.</p>
            </j-card-section>
          </j-card>
          <j-card class="pipeline-step">
            <j-card-section>
              <div class="pipeline-step__head">
                <span class="pipeline-step__num">02</span>
                <j-icon name="build" aria-hidden="true"></j-icon>
              </div>
              <h3>Build</h3>
              <p>Constrained build with signed provenance and immutable output.</p>
            </j-card-section>
          </j-card>
          <j-card class="pipeline-step">
            <j-card-section>
              <div class="pipeline-step__head">
                <span class="pipeline-step__num">03</span>
                <j-icon name="verified" aria-hidden="true"></j-icon>
              </div>
              <h3>Verify</h3>
              <p>Install, health, restart, and evidence gates on a clean host.</p>
            </j-card-section>
          </j-card>
          <j-card class="pipeline-step">
            <j-card-section>
              <div class="pipeline-step__head">
                <span class="pipeline-step__num">04</span>
                <j-icon name="rocket_launch" aria-hidden="true"></j-icon>
              </div>
              <h3>Deploy</h3>
              <p>The user reviews requirements before NexRun creates an instance.</p>
            </j-card-section>
          </j-card>
        </div>
      </section>
    </main>
  </j-page>
</template>
